      "id": "LUG-07",
      "plano": "gale-planta3",
      "provisional": false,
      "nota": "<p><strong>Location:</strong> @UUID[JournalEntry.zSkwEUUtkNGhfXun]{Gale Sentinel Campus and Data Center}<br><strong>Scenes:</strong> @UUID[JournalEntry.5hwXPdn0tUJ3NaKZ.JournalEntryPage.wIpc0OR2nQf7WDFO]{A1-E05 · The City's Eyes} · @UUID[JournalEntry.C7cxKf7kcAELzuJ1.JournalEntryPage.EjJ0vfVBCjTTb0QV]{A3-E02 · The Data Center}</p>\n<p><strong>Layer 2 of A3-E02: the offices.</strong> “Third floor: Preston Gale&#39;s office. Office server room.” Every door leading off the landing, plus the doors to the office and the server room, has an <strong>electronic lock</strong>: Dexterity + Larceny Diff. 3, or Intelligence + Technology Diff. 3.</p>\n<p><strong>The patrol.</strong> Dawson and two security ghouls (MEN-04) come through every 40 minutes: they come up the stairs or the elevator, walk the north hallway, cross the open-plan floor, and return to the landing. Avoiding them: Wits + Stealth Diff. 3 for the whole group (Auspex, Heightened Senses: +2 dice; they can be heard coming from the landing). Hiding spots: behind the open-plan workstations, the kitchenette, the conference room (but it has glass partitions). Dawson smells Kindred within twenty meters: from the landing he reaches any point on the floor.</p>\n<p><strong>Gale&#39;s office</strong> (southwest corner, with a window wall overlooking the parking lot). On the <strong>desk</strong>, Gale&#39;s computer: Intelligence + Investigation Diff. 3. One success: <strong>Preston Gale&#39;s digital signature on the Market Street access authorizations (P-11)</strong>. Three or more: also <strong>the “C.H.” email</strong>: “Recover all copies. Top priority. — C.H.”, dated November 13. The payment records to Lonnie from Cascade Holdings (P-14) are also there, if they don&#39;t already have them. If Celeste came as a shareholder and Gale receives her, it&#39;s here: the chair behind the desk, the sofa facing the door.</p>\n<p><strong>Office server room</strong> (northwest). The rack at the back is the <strong>poorly secured test server</strong> from A1-E05 (if the coterie goes in person instead of remotely): Intelligence + Technology Diff. 4 to get in; Intelligence + Investigation Diff. 3 for the November 9 order authorized by “P.G.” (P-06); DOC-11 is in the “Q1_board_deck_DRAFT” folder (automatic). If they fail, Gale logs the attempt (Thermometer +1 the following night).</p>\n<p><strong>North window wall.</strong> From the hallway you can see the service yard and the windowless hulk of the data center, humming.</p>\n<p>Stairs and elevators go down to the lobby (<code>gale-sentinel</code>). Chairs in the open-plan floor and the conference room: optional tiles, not listed one by one.</p>\n\n<p class=\"sbn-moviles\">The movable furniture (4) are unlocked tiles: they can be moved, knocked over or used as a barricade.</p>\n<div class=\"sbn-figuras\"><p><strong>Placed tokens.</strong> Hidden ones are revealed from the token layer; the ones that depend on how the night went say when.</p><ul><li>@UUID[Actor.Nq5NRC7yFhdkA5Er]{Dawson} · <em>hidden</em> (A3-E02): The patrol: Dawson and two ghouls come through every 40 minutes (north hallway, open-plan floor, landing).</li><li>@UUID[Actor.BzNGxOAK3F6Uo56T]{Security Guard 1} · <em>hidden</em> (A3-E02)</li><li>@UUID[Actor.BzNGxOAK3F6Uo56T]{Security Guard 2} · <em>hidden</em> (A3-E02)</li><li>@UUID[Actor.OE0huDRYvrhnxa9O]{Preston Gale} · <em>hidden</em> (A3-E02): Only if Celeste came as a shareholder and Gale receives her in his office, nervous.</li></ul></div>",
      "moviles": []
    }
